# Frontend environment variables

# Base URL of the backend API (protocol + host + optional port, no trailing slash).
# Examples:
#   http://localhost:3001
#   https://your-host.example.com
REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Notes:
# - In preview, the app auto-derives the backend as same host on port 3001 if not set.
# - If your backend is on a different host/port, set this to avoid "Failed to fetch" or CORS errors.
# - Ensure the backend enables CORS for the frontend origin (e.g., http://localhost:3000 or your preview host).
